# Issue Tracking Policy: None

No issue tracker is selected. The user may still choose to use an issue for a
particular change.

## Rules

- Do not require an issue identifier.
- Do not create or link an issue unless the user explicitly asks to use one.

## Rationale

Issue tracking is optional; this policy leaves that decision with the user.
